# The image build reads only the paths listed below. Everything else stays out
# of the build context: git history, tests, virtualenvs, caches, .env files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.lock.txt
!scripts
!src
# Generated at build time from scripts/demo-key.txt.
src/bca_mcp/_demo_key.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
